                                                "sense_id": "c2c88564-e497-3a7f-8f78-b0e909c3783d",
                                                "text": "Eau de Nil (“water of the Nile”) is a tricky color to pin down precisely. It is a light-greenish hue, more saturated than celadon, less gray than sage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f465e6c-2d3a-31ae-990c-1e579936a8e9",
